# semgrep ignore list (gitignore syntax).
#
# frontend/ is the React reference portal. semgrep's default JS/TS rules flag
# jsx-not-internationalized on every user-facing string (~60 findings) and a
# few style rules (package version ranges, JSON.stringify keys). This sample
# intentionally ships a single-language demo UI — internationalization is out
# of scope for a reference implementation — so the portal is excluded from
# semgrep. Security-relevant logic lives in the backend control plane and the
# runtime kernels, which are still scanned.
frontend/

